H3 Visual Studio — integrated MiniMax H3 Director runtime

Optional proxy integration: Mihomo, maintained by MetaCubeX,
https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo (GPL-3.0).
The Studio communicates with Mihomo as a separate process through its local
REST/HTTP interfaces. No Mihomo source or executable is included in this
distribution. The optional installer fetches the official v1.19.32 asset,
verifies its published SHA256, and retains its unmodified LICENSE and exact
release/source URL beside the privately installed executable. Do not treat
that executable as covered by the Studio's Apache-2.0 license or include
private subscription/runtime files when redistributing this plugin.

This distribution includes code from:
  MiniMax H3 Director, maintained by AI搅拌手 / AIMixer
  https://github.com/AIMixer/ComfyUI_MiniMaxH3_Director
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE and director_core/LICENSE)

The runtime was copied from the user-provided MiniMaxComfyUiPlugin source
on 2026-10-21. No upstream commit identifier was available. Original Python
source hashes are retained in director_core/source-manifest.json.
Upstream documentation and acknowledgments are preserved verbatim in
director_core/UPSTREAM_README.md. Existing source notices remain intact.
The supplied upstream source contained no separate NOTICE file.

Local integration and changes:
  - Studio-specific node registration and reference-group adapter.
  - Studio UI and project data compiled to the Director executor.
  - director_core/director/refine_pack.py modified to honor an explicit
    Studio target canvas. A change notice is present in that source file.
  - director_core/__init__.py is a local, registration-free initializer.
Upstream UI and HTTP management routes are not registered by this package.

